caption_text =
"Table 8. Step-Up MLM Results for Integrity Ratings",
footnote_text =
"Role was effect coded as inspector = 1 and investigator = −1. QRP Severity was effect coded as minor = −1, moderate = 0, and major = 1. Model comparison χ² values are likelihood-ratio tests comparing each model with the preceding model. * p < .05. ** p < .01. *** p < .001."
)
